=========================
JS - Array  - []  / typeof
-group of elements/values/objects as one entity
-allowed duplicates
-allowed heterogenesou
-storing based on indexing
-insertion order maintained
-JS - array is Iteratable object
- we can iterate using
	a)for loop
	b)while loop
	c)do-while loop
	d)for-of loop

JS - Object / {}  / typeof 
-->group of key:value pairs as one entity
   group of properties(property name and value)
-->duplicate keys are not allowed
-->allowed heterogenous
--> Indexing not applicable.
--> Insertion order no guarantee.
--> JS Object - not iterable
    
--> ES5 - New for loop ie: for-in loop 
